    <string name="env_leave_unsaved">The environment variables have unsaved changes.</string>
    <string name="env_name_hint">NAME (e.g. TU_DEBUG)</string>
    <string name="env_note">"Applied to the game process at its next start, before the Vulkan driver (system or custom) and DXVK are loaded. A driver reads its environment only when it starts: a change during a match needs a game restart. Variables cannot create features the driver or GPU does not have. TU_DEBUG set here replaces \"Turnip options\". Not accepted: LD_* (Android reads them only when the process is created), PATH, *CLASSPATH, ANDROID_* (Android's own environment) and DXVK_WSI_DRIVER."</string>
    <string name="env_problem_android">set by Android for the app process; changing it would break the app</string>
